  data: {
    LLM: "1. Draw one card from the stock or discard pile.\n2. Form melds in hand (but do not lay them down on the table until the end).\n3. End of Turn: Discard one card. If you wish to end the round, announce 'Knock' before or during the discard.",
    Player: "1. Draw one card from the stock or discard pile.\n2. Form melds in hand (but do not lay them down on the table until the end).\n3. End of Turn: Discard one card. If you wish to end the round, announce 'Knock' before or during the discard.",
    objective: 'Form sets (3-4 of a kind) and runs (3+ in suit) and have the lowest point total of unmatched cards (deadwood) when the round ends.',
